{"id":"41b8acdface5d65a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-type.md","title":"Dependent type judgment","display":"df-type — Dependent type judgment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-type","aliases":["16-df-type","Dependent type judgment"],"display":"df-type — Dependent type judgment","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§10.1 p.585 (PDF 605); explicit judgment closure in 16-df-dtt-signature","formalization_scope":"Dependent type judgment for the finite strong first-order presentation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-type</span><span>Dependent type judgment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type — Dependent type judgment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 p.585 (PDF 605); explicit judgment closure in 16-df-dtt-signature"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Dependent type judgment for the finite strong first-order presentation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\)</span>。原始语法、良构语境及判断闭包取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为本文件引入的谓词与类型集合缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{type}\">\\(\\mathsf{type}\\)</span> 是旧显示标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span> 是规范判断标签。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A\\ \\mathsf{type}\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A\\ \\mathsf{type}\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范规则闭包的正则性保证类型判断蕴含语境良构，故最后一个等价式成立。本文件不再把未给出定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 当成外部原语。</li>\n<li>此处是依赖类型判断，不是模型论的 complete/partial type。来源：§10.1 p.585（PDF 605）；完整选定演算及其边界见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$；$\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}$、$A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}$。原始语法、良构语境及判断闭包取 [[16-df-dtt-signature]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"此处是依赖类型判断，不是模型论的 complete/partial type。来源：§10.1 p.585（PDF 605）；完整选定演算及其边界见 [[16-df-dtt-signature]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{RawCtx}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{RawTy}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A\\ \\mathsf{type}\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A:\\mathsf{Ty}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\land A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ctx}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\Sigma","display":false}],"bytes":1607,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-type|df-type — Dependent type judgment]]"}],"outgoing":["3b1238220cc5942f"]}